    "sections": {
        "description": "The Bike Repair Garage is a free, modern, and easy-to-use theme designed for bike mechanics, two-wheeler workshops, motorcycle service centers, scooter repair shops, auto bike garages, and automotive maintenance professionals aiming to build a strong digital presence. Suitable for small bike repair garages, motorcycle workshops, tuning centers, and roadside bike assistance services, this theme helps showcase services like bike servicing, motorcycle repair, engine tuning, bike restoration, brake repair, chain replacement, oil change, wheel alignment, battery replacement, bike diagnostics, and bike modification with clarity and professionalism. Its clean layout and professional styling ensure services are presented in a visually engaging and trustworthy manner, while the fully responsive and SEO-ready structure delivers a seamless experience across mobile phones, tablets, and desktops. The theme supports flexible customization options such as color settings, typography choices, slider banners, header styles, service sections, testimonials, and call-to-action blocks, making it easy to highlight expertise in two-wheeler maintenance, motorcycle detailing, emergency repair services, and mobile mechanic solutions. Built for both beginners and professionals, it integrates smoothly with Contact Form 7 to manage customer inquiries, service requests, and appointment bookings efficiently. Ideal for bike repair shops, motorcycle technicians, and local service garages, the Bike Repair Garage theme offers a dependable, stylish, and high-performance foundation to strengthen brand identity, attract new customers, and grow a two-wheeler repair business online."
    },
